    <item>
      <title>CCS 2025 · Siena, Italy</title>
      <link>https://moyarzun.netlify.app/talk/ccs-2025/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://moyarzun.netlify.app/talk/ccs-2025/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;At CCS 2025 I participated with two pieces of work: a presentation on &lt;strong&gt;local and global collective memory&lt;/strong&gt; and a poster on &lt;strong&gt;friendship-based inequality in childhood cooperation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I like having both kinds of participation recorded in the same place, because conferences often work as milestones for multiple projects at once. Over time this page can grow into a richer record with slides, poster images, photos, and short takeaways.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;photos&#34;&gt;Photos&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#photos&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;anchor-symbol&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; height=&#34;26&#34; width=&#34;26&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 22 22&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;path d=&#34;M0 0h24v24H0z&#34; fill=&#34;currentColor&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;      &lt;path d=&#34;M3.9 12c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1h4V7H7c-2.76.0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5h4v-1.9H7c-1.71.0-3.1-1.39-3.1-3.1zM8 13h8v-2H8v2zm9-6h-4v1.9h4c1.71.0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1s-1.39 3.1-3.1 3.1h-4V17h4c2.76.0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;talk-gallery&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;figure&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;IMG_5739.jpeg&#34; alt=&#34;Presentation at CCS 2025 in Siena&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption&gt;Presenting in Siena.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;  &lt;figure&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;4FE6E11C-FCF1-4C5D-94BE-DB98843C4920.png&#34; alt=&#34;Portrait from CCS 2025 in Siena&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption&gt;A portrait from the conference.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;  &lt;figure&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;IMG_5835.jpeg&#34; alt=&#34;Poster session at CCS 2025 in Siena&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption&gt;With the poster during the conference.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;  &lt;figure&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;IMG_5838.jpeg&#34; alt=&#34;Conference selfie at CCS 2025 in Siena&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption&gt;A conference moment with collaborators.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;  &lt;figure&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;IMG_5876.jpeg&#34; alt=&#34;Social moment at CCS 2025 in Siena&#34; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption&gt;One of the informal moments that also make conferences memorable.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>EUSN 2022 · London, UK</title>
      <link>https://moyarzun.netlify.app/talk/eusn-best-poster-2022/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 01 Sep 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://moyarzun.netlify.app/talk/eusn-best-poster-2022/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;At the European Conference on Social Networks, I presented a poster on &lt;strong&gt;social interactions and school coexistence in neurodiverse elementary classrooms&lt;/strong&gt;. This work later fed into a broader line of research on social integration, reciprocity, and classroom network structure.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The event was especially meaningful because the poster received a &lt;strong&gt;Best Poster award&lt;/strong&gt;. I would like this page to eventually hold the poster image, a short explanation of the project, and notes that could later become a LinkedIn post or a public summary.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
